# Vercel uploads the repository, and neither deployment needs the mobile build
# artefacts. The release APK alone is ~130 MB, which exceeds Vercel's 100 MB
# upload limit and fails the deploy outright.
#
# The workspace directories themselves stay — `npm install` runs from the
# repository root and every workspace listed in package.json must exist — so
# only the generated output is excluded.
apps/mobile/android/app/build
apps/mobile/android/build
apps/mobile/android/.gradle
apps/mobile/android/.cxx
apps/mobile/ios/build
apps/mobile/.expo
